Id%22%3A%22u380fd4e9-e0df-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A395.7777862548828%2C%22height%22%3A74%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pwm02.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A7194%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A454%2C%22originHeight%22%3A85%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22CATDLUBANCAT%3A%24LS%2FSYS%2FCLASS%2FPWM%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A2%2C%22width%22%3A268%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PWMCHUPEPWMCHUP1PWMCHUP2%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CATDLUBANCAT%3AW%24%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A128%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CATDLUBANCAT%3AW%24%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CATDLUBANCAT%3AW%24%22%2C%22x%22%3A7%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PWMCHP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A225%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PWMCHUP4%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PWM10%22%2C%22x%22%3A359%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PWM8%22%2C%22x%22%3A196%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PWM9%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ASS%2FPWM%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A3%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A9%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A160%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23282523%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uffa0c31a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"V5hWi\" id=\"V5hWi\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdc60b01\" id=\"ucdc60b01\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">使用python-periphery</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u0e9ed2d7\" id=\"u0e9ed2d7\"><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u656f1066\" id=\"u656f1066\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8bf2c3b\" id=\"ue8bf2c3b\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ubd0503a3\" id=\"ubd0503a3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 库支持的PWM输出是基于Linux的PWM子系统实现的，所以要想利用该库做PWM输出， 需要板卡提供支持。像鲁班猫板卡，就可以完美使用 </span><a href=\"https://python-periphery.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u525ebea6\" id=\"u525ebea6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e428feb\" id=\"u2e428feb\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub8a9ce68\" id=\"ub8a9ce68\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 库实现PWM输出。 这样这样一来，就不需要我们在软件层面上利用GPIO模拟PWM输出。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"KdlVh\" id=\"KdlVh\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u566ab0de\" id=\"u566ab0de\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">安装 python-periphery</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20pip3%20install%20python-periphery%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v7hsw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"BoGHC\" id=\"BoGHC\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd4696ab\" id=\"ufd4696ab\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">periphery输出PWM</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20periphery%20import%20PWM%5Cnimport%20time%5Cn%5Cntry%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%E9%80%92%E5%A2%9E%E6%AD%A5%E9%95%BF%5Cn%20%20%20%20step%20%3D%200.05%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89range%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%20rangeMax%20%3D%20int(1%2F0.05)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%20PWM%208%2C%20channel%200%20%2C%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E6%9D%BF%E4%B8%8APWM8%E5%A4%96%E8%AE%BE%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm%20%3D%20PWM(1%2C%200)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AEPWM%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E9%A2%91%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%BA%201%20kHz%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.frequency%20%3D%201e3%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%E4%B8%BA%200%25%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E5%86%85%E9%AB%98%E7%94%B5%E5%B9%B3%E7%9A%84%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8E%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AA%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%94%E4%BE%8B%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%200.00%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AFPWM%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.enable()%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(0%2CrangeMax)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BC%91%E7%9C%A0step%E7%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(step)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%8D%A0%E7%A9%BA%E6%AF%94%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E5%8A%A0%20step%25%20%2C%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20round%20%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E8%AF%AF%E5%B7%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%20round(pwm.duty_cycle%2Bstep%2C2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B8%B8%E7%81%AD1%E7%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%3D%200.0%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(0%2CrangeMax)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(step)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%20round(pwm.duty_cycle-step%2C2)%5Cnexcept%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22Some%20errors%20occur!%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%5Cnfinally%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E6%97%B6%E7%86%84%E7%81%ADLED%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.duty_cycle%20%3D%200.0%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E9%87%8A%E6%94%BE%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%5Cn%20%20%20%20pwm.close()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wYNMn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u537c0af1\" id=\"u537c0af1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc14676ec\" id=\"uc14676ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">代码说明：</span></p><ul list=\"u6dd1dedf\"><li fid=\"u0d51014c\" data-lake-id=\"u98840cbc\" id=\"u98840cbc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ffab680\" id=\"u4ffab680\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第10行，创建了一个PWM对象</span></li><li fid=\"u0d51014c\" data-lake-id=\"u02a79a56\" id=\"u02a79a56\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a57699e\" id=\"u6a57699e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第12、14行，分别对该PWM对象的参数做了初始化，分别是PWM输出波形的频率、占空比</span></li><li fid=\"u0d51014c\" data-lake-id=\"u040a746e\" id=\"u040a746e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68c4011e\" id=\"u68c4011e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">第16行，根据对应的参数，使能PWM波形输出</span></li></ul>",
